WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.448 --> 00:00:03.449
(background chatter)

00:00:05.285 --> 00:00:06.058
- (thinking) Oh.

00:00:06.611 --> 00:00:08.816
Janine just liked one of
my photos on Instagram.

00:00:09.272 --> 00:00:10.200
That's weird.

00:00:10.463 --> 00:00:12.136
I've never even talked to Janine.

00:00:12.616 --> 00:00:14.913
Like why would she like one of my photos?

00:00:15.143 --> 00:00:16.003
She doesn't seem like a person

00:00:16.003 --> 00:00:18.243
that will like just
any photo on Instagram.

00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:20.543
What's this mean?

00:00:20.884 --> 00:00:21.943
Does she like me?

00:00:23.724 --> 00:00:24.724
Oh my God.

00:00:25.564 --> 00:00:26.444
That's it.

00:00:27.124 --> 00:00:28.244
She hit the heart.

00:00:28.704 --> 00:00:31.064
She gave me her heart.

00:00:31.424 --> 00:00:32.784
It's so obvious now.

00:00:33.344 --> 00:00:34.857
How could I have been so blind.

00:00:34.857 --> 00:00:35.744
The signs.

00:00:36.664 --> 00:00:39.105
Liking my photo and ...

00:00:40.024 --> 00:00:41.705
Well, just liking my photo.

00:00:41.945 --> 00:00:44.385
If that's your quirky way
of asking me out, yes.

00:00:44.645 --> 00:00:45.905
I will go out with you.

00:00:45.928 --> 00:00:47.025
Will I be your boyfriend?

00:00:47.025 --> 00:00:47.817
Duh.

00:00:47.817 --> 00:00:49.225
Is that too upfront?

00:00:49.485 --> 00:00:50.265
Well, you were upfront enough

00:00:50.265 --> 00:00:52.785
to profess your love to me on Instagram.

00:00:52.885 --> 00:00:55.005
No ones ever made me feel the way

00:00:55.005 --> 00:00:56.525
you make me feel right now.

00:00:56.525 --> 00:00:57.385
Food tastes better.

00:00:57.385 --> 00:00:58.846
Flowers smell better.

00:00:58.846 --> 00:01:01.446
I don't have a care in the world.

00:01:01.593 --> 00:01:03.486
What color should my wedding tux be?

00:01:04.186 --> 00:01:05.306
(intense music)

00:01:08.046 --> 00:01:10.926
Did you just like Zack's photo?

00:01:11.072 --> 00:01:12.422
Wait, what's going on here?

00:01:13.916 --> 00:01:16.519
Are you cheating on me?

00:01:17.717 --> 00:01:18.426
(crying)

00:01:18.555 --> 00:01:19.242
Okay.

00:01:19.649 --> 00:01:20.779
We can work through this.

00:01:21.329 --> 00:01:22.677
We're gonna have twins.

00:01:22.754 --> 00:01:24.123
We're gonna be so happy.

00:01:24.123 --> 00:01:25.420
No wait, no.

00:01:25.420 --> 00:01:26.672
How could you?

00:01:26.672 --> 00:01:27.443
Zack?

00:01:27.443 --> 00:01:28.479
Why Zack?

00:01:28.479 --> 00:01:30.699
He was gonna be the
best man at our wedding.

00:01:31.519 --> 00:01:33.115
(yelling) Fuck you, Janine!

00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:35.214
We're done.

00:01:35.626 --> 00:01:36.499
We're through!

00:01:37.339 --> 00:01:38.159
Why?

00:01:40.039 --> 00:01:42.346
- Oh, Janine just liked
my photo on Instagram.

00:01:43.131 --> 00:01:43.765
Eh.

00:01:44.779 --> 00:01:45.799
(upbeat music)

